      "Ms. Wheeler, I’m calling from Bernard Flooring. Unfortunately, we have to postpone your Tuesday appointment to have new carpet laid in your home. We’re going to be understaffed for the next couple of days and won’t be able to make it then. Thursday is the earliest we can come.",
      "That’s going to be inconvenient for me, as I’ll be busy on that day. Could you possibly do the work on Wednesday instead?",
      "No, we’re fully booked on Wednesday as well. To make up for the inconvenience, though, I can take 15 percent off your final bill.",
